Promise chains can become long.

asyncandawaitwere created to reduce nesting and improve readability.

The same flow withasyncandawaitis easier to read.

### Code Snippets

```
// Create an async function
async function hello() {
return "Hello World!";
}
// Call the async function
hello().then(function(value) {
myDisplayer(value);
});

